Package: bayesmetaipd
Title: Bayesian Random-Effects Meta-Analysis for IPD and AD
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: person("Yuan", "Zhou", email = "yuanzhouu@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bayesian hierarchical random-effects meta-analysis models
    combining individual participant data (IPD) and aggregate data (AD) for
    continuous outcomes via 'fit_ipd_ad_lm()'. Accommodates diverse AD reporting
    paradigms (nested working models, subgroup means, and partial coefficients)
    with semi-parametric density-ratio modeling (DRM) for covariate shift
    adjustment and high-performance C++ (Rcpp) acceleration.
